      "content": "that makes sense, but what about the people in specific countries who lose their jobs cuz of it? i hear a lot about how these deals basically gut domestic manufacturing and give all the power to big global corps instead of actual nations. is there a real counter-argument to that or is it just people being resistant to change?",
